{
  "description": "A 1.1 Discord bridge connector: message_id_scope stable, edits, deletes, durable per-user reactions (message.reaction in place of reaction, because the hub's welcome.subscribe asks for it by name), typing. An inbound reply to an older message (remote_reply_to), an edit, reactions with counts, a verified author delete; then the hub's own relayed line (webhook_id, relay_ref) edited and deleted through message.edit / message.delete.",
  "grounding": "Discord tells who deleted a message only through the audit log, so verified=true means the connector checked. Webhook lines are the hub's own masquerade, recognised by webhook_id and relay_ref.",
  "frames": [
